        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Amazing experience at Chrysler Vaudreuil. A big thank you to Moe, Daniel, Eric, and Pamela for their outstanding service. The whole team was professional, honest, and very welcoming. They took the time to explain everything clearly and made the process smooth. I’m extremely happy with my vehicle and highly recommend this dealership to anyone looking for excellent service and a great team.",
