        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "arpad vlad Kertesz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114757134897775422033/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVEyayhFDvMSHwmYfDSryHqz9Oe9sjBil2KlgjYugpM0JOYJMxw-A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "I recently purchased a Ram from Vaudreuil Dodge Jeep Ram - Fiat, and the entire experience was nothing short of exceptional.\n\nFrom the moment I walked in, I was treated with professionalism, courtesy, and genuine care. A big thank you to Mohamed, Erick, Charles, and Daniel—each of them was incredibly helpful throughout the process. They took the time to answer all my questions, guide me through my options, and made sure I felt confident every step of the way.\n\nSpecial shoutout to Pamela in financing, who made the final steps easy and stress-free. She explained everything clearly, found the best options for me, and made sure I was comfortable with the entire process.\n\nIf you're looking for a Ram—or any vehicle in the Dodge, Jeep, or Fiat family—I highly recommend Vaudreuil Dodge Jeep Ram - Fiat. The team is professional, knowledgeable, and truly puts the customer first. I couldn’t be happier with my purchase!",
        "time": 1752188036,
        "translated": false
      },
